Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:04.74,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,When the snow falls onto the lights,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.14,0:00:08.28,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,it blurs them and makes them \Nsparkle even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:11.43,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,I just love seeing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:16.62,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,That's another reason why I love the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:21.75,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,Huh? Did I say something weird?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:23.33,Flashback,YUKI {flashback},0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:30.15,Flashback,YUKI {flashback},0,0,0,,I was just happy to hear you say \Nyou loved me, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:33.95,Flashback,YUKI {flashback},0,0,0,,I know you were only referring \Nto my namesake, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:36.51,Flashback,YUKI {flashback},0,0,0,,It felt good to hear it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:41.05,FlashbackItalics,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:45.63,FlashbackItalics,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:53.91,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,I wonder what the definition of love is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:56.14,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,In the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:01:00.63,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,I once confessed my love to a girl \NI used to hang out with all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.12,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,And she said to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.05,0:01:07.88,Flashback,GIRL,0,0,0,,Hitoyoshi, what you're feeling isn't love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.76,Flashback,GIRL,0,0,0,,It's just a desire for companionship. \NThat's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:13.02,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,And I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:14.30,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,Come to think of it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:18.34,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,I had been desperately lonely,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:22.96,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,and I felt as though talking to her \Nsaved me from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.50,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,That was why I'd confessed to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:30.41,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,After that, we never hung out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:34.53,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,My confession probably hurt her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.67,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,and her response certainly hit me harder \Nthan a regular refusal would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:44.53,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,But if what she said was true,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.53,0:01:47.25,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,and that feeling wasn't love,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:53.90,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,then what is it that I'm feeling right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.93,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\fs8\c&H515151&\pos(301,225)\3c&HF5F5F5&}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:29.48,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,474)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H252AC4&}11{\c&H000000&}: {\c&H252AC4&}Your{\c&H000000&} Prayers are the Gods' Prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:52.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Good morning, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:54.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:05.54,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ugh... No, this is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.93,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:10.42,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki's been having nightmares \Nrecently, so I told her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:13.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, if you wanna sleep next to me, \Njust say the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:17.02,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I can't believe I just blurted out \Nsomething like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.53,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And I hate my past self for saying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:23.60,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I haven't been able to get a wink of sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:26.02,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I can't take much more of this, physically...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:30.70,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,and given that we're together more often due\Nto winter break, the timing couldn't be worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:33.87,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:36.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:41.88,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No, no... I just wanted to get an early start \Non the end-of-year cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:47.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,As if... What a terrible excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.23,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:09.37,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I have to put a stop to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:12.29,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,For my sake and Ms. Yuki's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:15.56,Flashback,GIRL,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:19.85,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,But even if I were to tell \NMs. Yuki my feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:25.30,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Nothing would happen, right? I mean, she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:38.90,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Mopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:41.96,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,is the one thing I haven't tried \Nsince the day I arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:45.53,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(942,394)\bord2\fnArial Black\c&HEDF5F1&\3c&H760071&\frz-20.52\fax-0.15\pos(203,98)}Horrible Blunder
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:45.50,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I blundered horribly at the time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.72,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Today is my chance to redeem myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.28,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I'll clean this place till it sparkles!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.99,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Maybe then, Master Hitoyoshi will cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:58.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Any other trash to throw out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:00.96,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Déjà vu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:03.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I can't apologize enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:07.17,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's okay. I know it's our furry friend's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:10.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't cause trouble for Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:14.60,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That said, Ms. Yuki really hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:18.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I cleaned the bath in the morning, \Nso you... can take...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:34.87,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:37.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ah... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:39.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I-I'll go run the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.38,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Nothing's changed on Ms. Yuki's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.34,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Though she's matured as a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:53.32,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,she's still just as genuine \Nand sincere as the day we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:07:00.42,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,and she treats us all as family in the \Nsame way I've always found comfort in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:03.04,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:06.31,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Am I really going to ruin all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:09.12,Flashback,MOTHER,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:13.39,Flashback,GIRL,0,0,0,,Hitoyoshi, you're probably just lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:17.22,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I never want to feel that way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:21.21,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And I don't want Ms. Yuki to leave me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:25.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:29.09,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You've been acting strangely since \Nthis morning, so I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:32.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Have you caught some manner of illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:33.34,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:37.48,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I just hurried off because I wanted \Nto get the bath filled quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:40.93,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ah! I know that smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:43.31,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That's her "I have prepared \Nmy lap for you" face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:47.02,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki, you shouldn't be doing that \Nwhen my feelings are all messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:50.61,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And what's with those puppy-dog eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:53.16,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I need to get out of this, at least for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um... I've been thinking about \Nthis for a while, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:08:00.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The whole resting my head on your lap thing... \NIt's kind of embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:02.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Normally, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:05.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,a high school boy would only ask a girl \Nto do something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:08.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,if he had more bravery \Nthan sense... or, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.23,0:08:14.05,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You're fed up with me, \Naren't you, Master Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:16.24,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No! That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.29,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I understand. After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I can't do anything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki... You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:35.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:40.13,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Wh-What? My eyes... They feel hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:42.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,They're hot, but water is coming out of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:48.15,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are these...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:51.49,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sorry! I didn't mean to make you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not fed up with you, \Nor anything of the sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:56.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I made her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:58.43,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What do I do? What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:06.19,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H333535&\3c&HC6C9C7&\pos(524.5,158)}Tends to run away\Nwhen things get bad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:00.48,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.09,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:06.19,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(569,1)\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H333535&\3c&HC6C9C7&\pos(298,41)}Self-esteem
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:04.98,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,But I know it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh... I know! The bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:11.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I don't want you to catch a chill, \Nso why don't you go use the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.65,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I shall do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:23.23,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Wait, what am I saying, \Nsending her off to the bath?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.79,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,This isn't the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.96,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That was the worst possible choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:33.34,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Seriously, what was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:37.88,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I just made things even more \Nawkward between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:51.52,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\fs8\pos(386,248.5)\c&H7D7C80&\3c&HD8D8DC&}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:51.52,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,Ever since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:54.68,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh... Did you forget to buy daikon radishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:57.24,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, we can make do without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:57.24,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,whenever anything happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:10:00.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I... I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.65,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki's tears would flood out \Nthrough the dam I'd broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:07.71,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,And so, not knowing how to repair it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.71,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Did he put on weight again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.21,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:16.47,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,I've just been doing the best \NI can not to make her sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:23.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,It's taking all my attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:29.90,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:30.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:33.05,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That one really wasn't your fault, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:35.64,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,I-If it's to stop her tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,sleeping next to each other is no exception!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:40.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh... Y-You can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:42.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:47.20,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,61... 67... 71... 73...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:49.21,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,Two sleepless nights later, \Nas a new day begins...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:53.48,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,1,091... 1,093... 1,097... 1,103... 1,109...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:57.63,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {N},0,0,0,,New Year's Eve is finally upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:03.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,But I was able to clean up my room, \Nthanks to Ms. Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:06.35,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I-I'll be sure to do better next... year...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:10.39,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\b0\c&HFBFEFB&\fs10\fax0.25\pos(558.5,264)\frz239.9}December 31st (Fri.)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:19.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,So soft...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.11,0:11:27.53,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, I was thinking of picking up \Nsomething for dinner on my walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:29.39,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"I'll be back in a bit"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:50.68,Default,CHILD1,0,0,0,,See you next year!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.51,Default,CHILD2,0,0,0,,Yeah! Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:02.07,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20\bord2.5\fnTimes New Roman\c&H0F120F&\3c&HEFF3EE&\pos(88,164.5)}We will be closed\Nuntil the new year.\NSincerely, Management
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:05.03,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\pos(320,34)\c&H303C8B&\3c&HE6E6E6&}Katsuda Side Dish Store
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:11.95,Default,SOBA STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. We're all out of New Year's soba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:14.88,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\pos(204.5,59)\3c&H582D3D&\c&HF2EAEB&}Soba
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:13.60,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:23.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Um... Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:28.51,Default,CLERK 1,0,0,0,,Our special end-of-year sale is on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:34.52,Default,CLERK 2,0,0,0,,New Year's osechi boxes are over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:38.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,People move so differently \Nwhen the year's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:49.36,Default,CLERK 3,0,0,0,,You have a good eye, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:51.77,Default,CLERK 3,0,0,0,,That's high-quality roast beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.61,Default,CLERK 3,0,0,0,,How many grams? Unsliced?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:56.00,Default,CLERK 3,0,0,0,,Very good! I'll give you a little extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:11.10,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\fs8\pos(386,248.5)\c&H4B4B4B&\3c&HD8D8DC&}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:10.01,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, I've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.10,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:15.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I picked up something for dinner \Nwhile I was out walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:16.81,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:21.73,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was thinking we could have your \Nfavorite okonomiyaki tonight, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:22.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:24.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:27.11,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I bought some roast beef, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:32.36,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,Roast beef...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:35.50,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\c&H232323&\3c&H666666&\frz6.884\fax-0.18\pos(392,271)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.75,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki! Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:39.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, they're not exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:42.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Mine is sliced, and yours isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.94,0:13:49.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:52.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh... You don't have to force \Nyourself to eat the lot, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:54.36,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:57.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:58.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Let us eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:08.11,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's delicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.79,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI {background},0,0,0,,Yeah, it's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:12.82,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Seriously, what am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:16.95,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I still ended up making her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:27.80,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I need to keep it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:36.23,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Dad gets home tomorrow, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:07.55,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki! Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:10.93,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H060806&\3c&HF9FDFA&\pos(429.5,129.5)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:08.99,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:10.93,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Next stop: our New Year's shrine visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Good morning, Ms. Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.02,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Are you guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:18.47,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:23.77,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was just calling for him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.77,0:15:25.82,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,He's not waking up at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:28.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes. He seems utterly exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:31.11,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ah... That's gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:33.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, he didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:39.79,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother's birthday is \NJanuary 1st. That's today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:41.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi's birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:46.29,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yup! So it's a family tradition to get together \Nafter the shrine visit every New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:47.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi's birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:51.05,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Well, we don't usually \Ngive presents or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.34,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,so I guess he doesn't actually \Nhave to be here for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:57.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I didn't... even know... his birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.02,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I've never heard tears make that noise before!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:03.39,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,More to the point, I've never \Nseen you cry before, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:05.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes... You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Apparently...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:13.31,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It seems some kind of dam \Nwithin me has broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:14.41,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs8\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H060806&\3c&HF9FDFA&\pos(302.5,221)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:14.41,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:18.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Because of that, I'm now liable to \Nstart crying for any reason at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:21.49,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,so perhaps it would be best \Nif I, too, stayed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:22.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:27.50,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I was planning to meet up with some \Nfriends anyway, so I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.52,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Okay, see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:48.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,From Ms. Naka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:52.74,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b0\frz30.19\fax0.12\pos(208.5,84)}January 1st (Sat.)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:52.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"Will you and Yokoya be coming \Nto the shrine today?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:56.16,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(271,1)\bord4\fnComic Sans MS\c&H0D1211&\3c&HF4FAFB&\pos(495.5,31.5)}Former Assassin,\NCurrently Speaking\Nto a Text Message
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:56.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I... was thinking of staying at home...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:17:01.08,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b0\frz30.19\fax0.12\pos(208.5,84)}January 1st (Sat.)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:17:01.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"I'd really like it if we could visit together."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:03.75,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Visit the shrine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:05.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,with Ms. Naka...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.98,0:17:12.09,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.76,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.36,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,So you came after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.06,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Your outfit's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.49,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Is it just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:20.46,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:24.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,In truth, I am not familiar with this \N"New Year's shrine visit" tradition...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.04,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:27.81,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,So you don't know how to pray at a shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:31.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm afraid I have very \Nlittle experience in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:32.94,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,On New Year's,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:37.16,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,it's traditional to visit a shrine so you can \Nconvey your wishes for the year to the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:39.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:45.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What are those white papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:46.87,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Those are fortune slips.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:49.88,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Each one has a fortune written on it \Nthat applies to the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.86,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Do you want to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:52.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:18:01.57,DefaultItalics,NAKA{M},0,0,0,,Being able to help out another person \Nby explaining things they don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:04.16,DefaultItalics,NAKA{M},0,0,0,,It's almost like we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:06.27,DefaultItalics,NAKA{M},0,0,0,,Oh, wait, we already are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.48,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, I got great luck—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:10.93,DefaultItalics,NAKA{M},0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.62,DefaultItalics,NAKA{M},0,0,0,,D-Did she just go "boo-womp"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.62,0:18:14.40,DefaultItalics,NAKA{M},0,0,0,,Seriously? Boo-womp?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.60,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I-It looks like the tears aren't stopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:18.92,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,W-Would you like to sit down somewhere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:26.62,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord3\fnTimes New Roman\an7\c&H30403B&\3c&HF3F6F3&}Fortune Slip\N{\fs24}Potential Luck\N\N{\fs12}Desires: Will come true if you are patient.\NAwaited Person: Will not show themselves for now.\NLost Item: Will remain missing and pass to another.\NBusiness: No changes, either profit or loss.\NAcademics: Be sure not to neglect your studies.\NDisputes: You may have difficulty gaining the upper hand.\NRomantic Partner: They are a good person. Believe in them.\NMoving Residency: Your current residence is ideal.\NSickness: Will recover. Seek a good doctor.\NMarriage Prospects: If you wait calmly, your doubts will clear,\Nand that which you envision will come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:26.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My lost item "will remain missing \Nand pass to another"...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:32.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I bet... Master Hitoyoshi and I... \Nwill be separated...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:34.09,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,That can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:41.68,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But I really do feel like Master Hitoyoshi \Nhas been acting differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:49.14,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,He's been so standoffish with me lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:57.11,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs13\fnTimes New Roman\c&H505351&\frz5.066\fax0.9\move(110,164,110,128.5,29,7954)}Potential Luck
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:56.60,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What if... it's only a matter of time before \NMaster Hitoyoshi no longer needs me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:19:02.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and I'm not able... to be with him anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:10.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,When I think things like that... \NI can't stop my tears from flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:14.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:18.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,begins to hate me... whatever... shall I....
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.82,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Um... You're not alone in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:25.82,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I've had times when my tears \Nwouldn't stop, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:28.05,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You have, Ms. Naka?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:30.89,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Yes, though it was when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:34.47,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,It was after my mother passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:38.39,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh! I didn't mean to make you sad again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:46.50,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,But at that time, I remembered something \Nmy mother had told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:52.07,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,We cry when we need to let out \Nsad feelings from inside of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:55.13,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,So cry as much as you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:59.46,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I bet the reason why your tears won't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:05.93,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,is that all the sad feelings you've bottled \Nup inside you are flowing out at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:10.08,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,That's why crying is nothing to be ashamed of!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:17.19,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,At times like these, you should cry and cry \Nuntil you've let all the sadness out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:21.09,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,And then, one day you'll get your smile back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:22.61,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I was the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.50,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Ms. Naka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:29.61,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,When you calm down, let's go say our prayers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:32.25,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,and have the gods do something \Nabout that fortune of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.11,0:20:36.28,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Here's how you pray at a shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.43,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,You bow twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:44.99,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,and then you clap twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:55.21,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Ms. Riko, Ms. Naka, and Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.11,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,They're always looking out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:21:04.51,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I wish to be able to stay with them all, \Nthis year and forever.
